{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/1509430-how-to-do-a-chosen-of-battles","id":1509430,"title":"How to do a chosen of battles","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Sidereal Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-04-23T19:38:04-07:00","id":1509430,"title":"How to do a chosen of battles","content":"I was experimenting with Sidereal character creation this afternoon. Chosen of battles includes Melee, Brawl, and Archery as caste skills. What do people do with those? The sidereal have strong incentives to invest heavily in martial arts. Do people just write off two or all three of the caste combat abilities? Do they delve into two of them and leave martial arts out of their plans for at least a while? Is there some fun thing to do with all three?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I want to play <a href=\"https://forum.atlas-games.com/t/adelbert-a-magi-of-hermes-look-at-intellego-and-astrology/8146/382\" target=\"_blank\">this</a> as a starting character, I don't even care what game.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/872-apromor","name":"Apromor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar872_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"245"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-24T16:48:05-07:00","id":1509535,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Apromor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/1509430-how-to-do-a-chosen-of-battles#post1509430\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was experimenting with Sidereal character creation this afternoon. Chosen of battles includes Melee, Brawl, and Archery as caste skills. What do people do with those? The sidereal have strong incentives to invest heavily in martial arts. Do people just write off two or all three of the caste combat abilities? Do they delve into two of them and leave martial arts out of their plans for at least a while? Is there some fun thing to do with all three?</div> </div> </div> </div>A character probably doesn't need both Melee and Brawl, whereas mixing Archery in not only provides versatile options for range and dealing with cover but some of the oddities of what Sidereals can make count as an arrow.<br /> <br /> As far as Martial Arts go, if the incentive to invest heavily is for Sidereal Styles, those Abilities have Charms now that allow one to substitute native combat Charms for Martial Arts in the prerequisite for getting a start on the big stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-08-22T14:23:38-07:00","id":1563350,"title":"","content":"I always thought it was kinda cool that the charms in those abilities kinda read as their own martial arts styles. They even have form charms. Thanks to aforementioned charms that allow them to count as martial arts for Sidereal Martial Arts, you can just focus into one and go from there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1767-thousand-forged-lurker","name":"Thousand forged lurker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1767_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}